@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Cross-boundary interaction — Applications and Files actual-material capture
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Authorized owner" as U
participant "Applications handler" as A
participant "Files public contract" as F
database "Owned application state" as DB
U -> A : actual event / material intent + command / versions
A -> A : current authority + intended capture provenance
A -> F : resolve exact usable material and protect reference
F --> A : protection / actual usability evidence or unavailable
alt source-required material and current guards satisfied
 A -> DB : coherent event / manifest / completeness / result commit
 DB --> A : actual committed capture identity
 A -> F : finalize using actual committed consumer evidence
 F --> A : confirmed finalization or unresolved acknowledgment
 A --> U : actual event and truthful material completeness
else denied / stale / unavailable material
 A --> U : safe actual result; no fabricated complete capture
end
note over A,F
 Concrete guard excludes reference registration racing physical deletion.
 Lost commit/finalization response reconciles same consumer/operation before release.
 No implicit send, publication, share activation or actual-recipient receipt claim.
end note
@enduml
